  dialogue:
  - Dialogue: "There\u2019s the kid of the hour! Has this been the best birthday
      ever?"
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 599283ca56aa9da4f85f3d7e2e07d0a4, type: 3}
  Charming_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: I was just like you when I was your age, always ready to prove to
        my friends that I was the best in whichever game we found fun at the time.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "You know it!! I can\u2019t wait to use these card to defeat
      all of my friends!"
    RelationshipCheckRequired: 0
    RelationshipRange: {x: 0, y: 0}
    BranchingDialogueHigh: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db646a170bec0244b8ff60a54ef21847, type: 2}
    BranchingDialogueNeutral: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogueLow: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 10
  Assertive_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: I remember being like that too when I was your age. Just be sure
        to spend time with your family every once in a while.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "I don\u2019t know.... I haven\u2019t opened up all my presents
      yet."
    RelationshipCheckRequired: 0
    RelationshipRange: {x: 0, y: 0}
    BranchingDialogueHigh: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db646a170bec0244b8ff60a54ef21847, type: 2}
    BranchingDialogueNeutral: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogueLow: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -5
  Sappy_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Me too kiddo, once my Dad gets better we can spend time all together
        again just like the good old days.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "Yeah, I\u2019m glad we got to spend time together as a family."
    RelationshipCheckRequired: 0
    RelationshipRange: {x: 0, y: 0}
    BranchingDialogueHigh: {fileID: 11400000, guid: db646a170bec0244b8ff60a54ef21847, type: 2}
    BranchingDialogueNeutral: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogueLow: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 15
  Charming_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "You don\u2019t have to worry about that kiddo, seeing you smile
